14	// lib/actions-mail.ts when sending). Auto-reply and forwarding are compiled to
15	// sieve and pushed to Mailcow — see lib/mail/sieve.ts.
16	//
17	// Storage quota is displayed only; the plan tier sets it, so there is no
18	// customer-facing write for it here.
