243	// The whole rule set is compiled into ONE managed script and pushed BEFORE the
244	// DB is written, so the stored preference and the live server never disagree.
245	// If Mailcow rejects the push the DB is left untouched and the customer sees the
246	// failure — the opposite of the "Saved" lie this replaces.
