1	// CalDAV engine for the native Nxeon Calendar + Tasks feature.
2	//
3	// Plain server-side module (NOT "use server"): it holds the short-lived tsdav
4	// DAVClient factory and the thin fetch/put/delete helpers shared by the server
5	// actions (lib/actions-calendar.ts). It talks to the customer's SOGo CalDAV
6	// collections over the mail server, authenticating with the SAME per-user
7	// mailbox credential the webmail client uses (see resolveMailbox). It is never
8	// imported into a client bundle.
