317	 * Only ONE filter per (username, filter_type) can be active at a time —
318	 * Mailcow deactivates the others whenever a filter is added/edited as active.
319	 * That is why lib/mail/sieve.ts compiles auto-reply AND forwarding into a
320	 * single managed script instead of one filter each.
